WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.271
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:13.541 --> 00:14.541
Lin Zai.

3
00:14.583 --> 00:16.333
How long are you going to keep this up?

4
00:17.083 --> 00:17.791
Lin Xian is dead.

5
00:17.792 --> 00:18.916
He died a long time ago.

6
00:18.958 --> 00:20.082
The moment he turned into a zombie,

7
00:20.083 --> 00:21.708
he stopped being your brother.

8
00:25.416 --> 00:26.916
Shut the hell up, A-Leh!

9
00:27.458 --> 00:29.416
Pull yourself together, Lin Zai!

10
00:30.000 --> 00:30.750
Let go of me!

11
00:30.751 --> 00:31.999
Stay out of my business!

12
00:32.000 --> 00:33.707
No matter how much you cry over that pile of dirt,

13
00:33.708 --> 00:34.708
it won't bring him back.

14
00:34.875 --> 00:35.750
Aside from torturing yourself,

15
00:35.751 --> 00:36.791
it's completely pointless.

16
00:37.000 --> 00:38.541
What the fuck do you know?!

17
00:58.208 --> 00:59.375
Is that all you've got?

18
00:59.625 --> 01:00.625
Come on, hit me again!

19
01:55.583 --> 01:56.583
It's okay. It's alright.

20
02:00.333 --> 02:01.333
It's all over now.

21
03:04.800 --> 03:08.800
"The Last Oath"

22
03:09.100 --> 03:13.600
(Episode 23: Communication After The Fall)

23
03:22.750 --> 03:24.166
Eat something.

24
03:24.416 --> 03:25.416
Just one bite.

25
04:15.958 --> 04:16.958
A-Leh.

26
04:17.708 --> 04:19.416
I want to go outside and get some sun.

27
04:21.375 --> 04:22.375
Okay.

28
04:33.000 --> 04:34.000
Brother,

29
04:34.750 --> 04:36.083
growing up,

30
04:36.916 --> 04:39.083
it feels like I competed with you in everything.

31
04:40.458 --> 04:41.458
Grades,

32
04:41.833 --> 04:43.125
competitions,

33
04:43.541 --> 04:44.541
experiments.

34
04:47.125 --> 04:48.375
Yet after all these years,

35
04:49.916 --> 04:51.333
I don't think I ever

36
04:52.583 --> 04:54.333
truly beat you once.

37
04:56.375 --> 04:58.000
You were always one step ahead of me.

38
04:59.916 --> 05:01.166
Even when you lost your way,

39
05:02.041 --> 05:03.583
you went further than I ever could.

40
05:06.375 --> 05:07.666
So this time,

41
05:08.916 --> 05:10.596
I want to be the one walking ahead of you.

42
05:23.579 --> 05:25.719
[Potassium Cyanide]

43
06:42.878 --> 06:43.878
Wait.

44
06:43.902 --> 06:45.194
I've gotten stronger.

45
06:51.625 --> 06:52.958
Am I still changing?

46
07:15.750 --> 07:17.125
Nice weather today.

47
07:18.875 --> 07:19.875
It's alright.

48
07:26.708 --> 07:27.874
Tell everyone to hide.

49
07:27.875 --> 07:28.750
I'll go check it out.

50
07:28.791 --> 07:29.791
Be careful.

51
07:30.458 --> 07:31.583
Get inside, quick!

52
07:32.208 --> 07:33.208
Go back!

53
07:33.333 --> 07:34.333
Get inside!

54
07:45.250 --> 07:46.583
Drop your weapons.

55
07:50.541 --> 07:51.375
Hey there, friends.

56
07:51.458 --> 07:52.498
Where are you coming from?

57
07:53.541 --> 07:54.541
What brings you here?

58
08:05.500 --> 08:06.791
Now, there's no need for that.

59
08:07.541 --> 08:08.916
Let's just talk this out.

60
08:09.541 --> 08:10.750
Why resort to violence?

61
08:11.083 --> 08:11.916
Cut the crap.

62
08:11.916 --> 08:12.916
Open the door.

63
08:26.750 --> 08:27.750
A-Leh!

64
08:38.583 --> 08:39.583
Leh Ri?

65
08:42.375 --> 08:43.375
You're still alive?

66
08:46.625 --> 08:47.625
What are you doing here?

67
08:48.416 --> 08:49.583
HQ just got a tip.

68
08:49.875 --> 08:50.583
There's an immune subject here.

69
08:50.584 --> 08:52.083
I already found the immune subject.

70
08:52.583 --> 08:54.083
I have him under control.

71
08:55.083 --> 08:56.708
Right now, he's locked up in—.

72
09:53.250 --> 09:54.666
They're from Herin.

73
09:56.208 --> 09:57.528
They came looking for the immune.

74
09:59.958 --> 10:00.958
So,

75
10:01.208 --> 10:02.500
you're with Herin too?

76
10:03.958 --> 10:05.583
But you just killed them all.

77
10:08.291 --> 10:09.291
Lin Zai.

78
10:10.000 --> 10:11.000
From now on,

79
10:11.791 --> 10:12.871
there are no more missions.

80
10:13.166 --> 10:14.166
No organization.

81
10:15.000 --> 10:16.000
There's only you.

82
10:20.899 --> 10:21.899
Really?

83
10:55.791 --> 10:56.916
Wherever you want to go,

84
10:57.125 --> 10:58.125
however you want to live,

85
10:58.541 --> 10:59.541
I'm with you.

86
11:05.750 --> 11:06.750
But...

87
11:08.208 --> 11:10.500
I can't even find a reason to live anymore.

88
11:14.083 --> 11:15.583
I couldn't find one either, once.

89
11:18.583 --> 11:19.666
Growing up,

90
11:20.086 --> 11:21.958
I only lived so I wouldn't be eliminated.

91
11:24.583 --> 11:25.916
My parents sold me off

92
11:26.916 --> 11:28.596
because I was just an extra mouth to feed.

93
11:29.583 --> 11:30.916
The organization trained me

94
11:31.000 --> 11:32.583
to use me as a weapon.

95
11:34.458 --> 11:35.708
My existence

96
11:37.500 --> 11:38.875
didn't mean a thing to anyone.

97
11:44.083 --> 11:45.208
Until I met you.

98
11:48.208 --> 11:49.750
You taught me what it's like to hurt,

99
11:50.375 --> 11:51.495
what it's like to be afraid,

100
11:52.666 --> 11:53.708
and how to

101
11:59.791 --> 12:00.791
love.

102
12:03.958 --> 12:05.358
If you can't find a reason to live,

103
12:06.750 --> 12:08.083
then let's

104
12:09.250 --> 12:10.750
be each other's reason.

105
12:12.166 --> 12:13.166
Okay?

106
12:25.541 --> 12:26.750
Can I do that?

107
12:47.875 --> 12:49.083
Leave me behind!

108
12:49.916 --> 12:50.916
Go!

109
12:56.125 --> 12:57.125
My name is Lin Zai.

110
12:57.208 --> 12:57.875
"Lin" as in forest,

111
12:58.041 --> 12:59.041
"Zai" as in the present.

112
12:59.791 --> 13:00.500
A-Leh.

113
13:00.500 --> 13:01.500
"Leh" as in raging fire.

114
13:10.083 --> 13:11.083
This is for you.

115
13:12.291 --> 13:13.291
A-Leh,

116
13:13.583 --> 13:14.958
do you want to stay?

117
13:15.333 --> 13:16.333
I came looking for you

118
13:17.000 --> 13:18.416
because you're immune.

119
13:18.958 --> 13:20.125
You bastard!

120
13:21.750 --> 13:22.999
And to think I treated you as a friend!

121
13:23.000 --> 13:24.833
I trusted you so much!

122
13:25.666 --> 13:26.749
Let go, you jerk!

123
13:26.750 --> 13:27.830
I need to use the bathroom.

124
13:27.916 --> 13:28.916
I'll help you.

125
13:43.708 --> 13:45.041
You're not tying him up?

126
13:46.750 --> 13:47.750
He's sleeping with me.

127
13:50.916 --> 13:52.582
Is there anything else in your heart right now

128
13:52.583 --> 13:53.583
besides your damn mission?

129
13:53.583 --> 13:54.583
Yes, there is.

130
14:03.750 --> 14:04.750
A-Leh,

131
14:05.000 --> 14:06.250
I'm begging you.

132
14:07.083 --> 14:08.583
Please just let me go, okay?

133
14:17.958 --> 14:18.958
It's yours now.

134
14:20.416 --> 14:21.416
Protect yourself.

135
14:41.958 --> 14:43.083
I will protect you

136
14:45.583 --> 14:46.583
with my life.

137
14:55.958 --> 14:57.083
In such a hurry to leave?

138
14:57.250 --> 14:58.541
Then go by yourself.

139
14:59.125 --> 15:00.291
I love you.

140
15:01.458 --> 15:02.708
But I don't love you.

141
15:03.125 --> 15:04.250
I don't believe it.

142
15:04.666 --> 15:05.666
I don't—.

143
15:07.750 --> 15:08.916
Why do you...

144
15:10.583 --> 15:12.263
Why do you smell like He Yao's cigarettes?

145
15:20.333 --> 15:21.333
Lin Zai,

146
15:40.958 --> 15:42.358
no matter what happens from now on,

147
15:43.083 --> 15:44.500
you have to tell me.

148
15:47.750 --> 15:49.458
Don't carry it all by yourself anymore.

149
15:51.500 --> 15:52.500
Okay.

150
16:05.125 --> 16:06.291
You can.

151
16:08.875 --> 16:10.166
We both can.

152
16:28.791 --> 16:29.791
A-Leh,

153
16:30.416 --> 16:32.000
does this mean you defected?

154
16:33.083 --> 16:34.500
Will they hunt you down?

155
16:36.750 --> 16:37.750
Don't worry.

156
16:38.000 --> 16:39.000
I know how to handle it.

157
16:45.333 --> 16:47.093
Your life before joining the organization...

158
16:47.333 --> 16:48.573
how much of it do you remember?

159
16:51.541 --> 16:52.541
Why do you ask?

160
16:53.916 --> 16:55.416
I just want to know more about you.

161
16:58.916 --> 17:00.250
I was very young back then.

162
17:01.791 --> 17:02.791
My parents' faces

163
17:02.792 --> 17:04.083
are all a blur now.

164
17:05.083 --> 17:07.166
My last memory of them

165
17:07.791 --> 17:09.500
is being dragged away while

166
17:11.916 --> 17:13.196
they stood there counting money.

167
17:14.166 --> 17:15.166
After that,

168
17:16.083 --> 17:18.123
I spent my whole life training in the organization.

169
17:20.666 --> 17:21.541
A-Leh

170
17:21.542 --> 17:22.750
isn't your real name, right?

171
17:23.208 --> 17:24.500
What's your real name?

172
17:26.083 --> 17:27.083
My real name?

173
17:28.083 --> 17:29.083
I...

174
17:29.333 --> 17:30.333
forgot.

175
17:30.958 --> 17:31.958
What?

176
17:32.541 --> 17:33.708
You definitely remember.

177
17:34.416 --> 17:35.125
I really don't.

178
17:35.125 --> 17:36.125
My name is just A-Leh.

179
17:37.083 --> 17:38.458
You won't even tell me this?

180
17:38.750 --> 17:39.416
You have to tell me!

181
17:39.666 --> 17:40.125
Come on!

182
17:40.375 --> 17:41.083
Spill it!

183
17:41.083 --> 17:42.083
Tell me!

184
17:42.166 --> 17:43.291
Tell me, please, please!

185
17:43.750 --> 17:44.166
Hurry!

186
17:44.250 --> 17:44.583
Come on!

187
17:44.916 --> 17:45.375
Just say it!

188
17:45.416 --> 17:46.708
Okay, okay, I'll tell you!

189
17:49.916 --> 17:51.083
My real name is...

190
17:53.333 --> 17:54.975
Gao Liang. [TN: It's like if he was named Johnny Appleseed]

191
17:55.000 --> 17:56.000
What?

192
17:56.875 --> 17:57.875
That's so corny!

193
17:58.916 --> 18:00.124
That's why I said I didn't remember,

194
18:00.125 --> 18:01.205
yet you insisted on asking.

195
18:03.875 --> 18:04.875
Gao Liang.

196
18:06.958 --> 18:08.291
Gao Liang, Gao Liang!

197
18:08.666 --> 18:10.066
Are you calling a damn dog or what?

198
18:10.916 --> 18:11.916
Honestly though,

199
18:12.076 --> 18:13.756
it kind of grows on me the more I say it.

200
18:14.208 --> 18:14.708
Gao Liang!

201
18:15.083 --> 18:16.333
Gao Liang, Gao Liang!

202
18:16.625 --> 18:17.625
Gao Liang!

203
18:25.958 --> 18:27.918
Looks to me like you're just asking to be kissed.

204
18:29.250 --> 18:30.333
And what if I am?

205
18:50.166 --> 18:51.166
What?

206
18:53.125 --> 18:54.125
Lin Zai,

207
18:54.416 --> 18:56.750
there's something I still need to tell you.

208
19:03.083 --> 19:04.083
Where is he?

209
19:08.375 --> 19:09.375
So,

210
19:09.875 --> 19:11.166
he lied to me about everything?

211
19:12.000 --> 19:13.000
Yes.

212
19:14.125 --> 19:15.916
I've already locked him up.

213
19:16.083 --> 19:17.250
What to do with him

214
19:17.666 --> 19:18.666
is up to you.

215
19:21.125 --> 19:22.625
Bad news! He Yao is gone!

216
19:23.750 --> 19:24.750
What?

217
19:25.458 --> 19:26.416
I'll go check it out.

218
19:26.416 --> 19:27.166
Wait for me here.

219
19:27.166 --> 19:28.166
Okay.

220
19:42.625 --> 19:43.625
Changhuan,

221
19:56.708 --> 19:58.583
I'm gonna find a place to... use the bathroom.

222
19:59.666 --> 20:00.666
Hey, who's there?!

223
20:19.291 --> 20:20.291
Brother,

224
20:20.916 --> 20:22.291
don't look for me anymore.

225
20:31.416 --> 20:33.291
By the time you read this,

226
20:34.083 --> 20:35.333
I'll probably

227
20:35.833 --> 20:37.291
be gone already.

228
20:38.666 --> 20:39.916
Let me

229
20:40.666 --> 20:42.083
end all of this.

230
20:43.791 --> 20:44.916
This can't be real.

231
20:45.916 --> 20:47.083
This can't be happening!

232
21:03.000 --> 21:04.000
Changhuan!

233
21:30.000 --> 21:31.083
Changhuan!
